<Legal title="Cookies" description="Reef Support's website does not use cookies, analytics or advertising trackers, so there is no cookie banner." updated="19 November 2026">
  <p>This website does not set cookies and does not use analytics, advertising or social media trackers. That is why there is no cookie banner.</p>
  <p>Fonts, images and scripts are served from our own domain. The only third-party request happens when you send a form: the message goes to FormSubmit, which delivers it to our inbox, as described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <p>If we ever add cookies or analytics, we will update this page first and ask for your consent where the law requires it.</p>
</Legal>
